# Build context allowlist for sagemaker_container/Dockerfile (BuildKit picks up
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile). The build runs from the
# project root, which also holds data/, .venv/ and model directories.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!pdm/
!sagemaker_container/serve.py
!sagemaker_container/inference.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
